{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$0 \\to \\mathcal{K}_1^\\bullet \\to \\mathcal{K}_2^\\bullet \\to\n\\mathcal{K}_3^\\bullet \\to 0$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{K}_3^\\bullet$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{K}_i^\\bullet$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-K-flat-two-out-of-three-ses}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9d1eb4468165bc8748ca3256caa35efb50fc2038d48b60823ab32ba8497980e4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5a640c53661399049cf584bed3cd47a0e1c8e202aee920aef958a335c78fdb51", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site. Let\n<MATH_0002> be a short exact sequence of complexes\nsuch that the terms of <MATH_0003> are flat <MATH_0004>-modules.\nIf two out of three of <MATH_0005> are K-flat, so is the third.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b3b5be5d8e826395668891c24b759edbdb2d1bcbec55d2fe9cf6f9da15f685e4", "unit_id": "tag:0G7B:statement"}
