{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\colim \\mathcal{K}_n^\\bullet \\to \\mathcal{G}^\\bullet$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-module-quotient-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{derived-lemma-special-direct-system}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0601c0bb077449d41401d2f1eb042b266cfd314fa312288f64ec3634bdbf38cd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:05fd0d33f6f1abe68943c1c9dd750e683a6a0d16bed2a97a16ccafd399c0648c", "source_text": "The existence of the diagram and properties (1), (2), (3) follows immediately\nfrom\nModules on Sites, Lemma <REF_0001>\nand\nDerived Categories, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nThe induced map\n<MATH_0001>\nis a quasi-isomorphism because filtered colimits are exact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:198e2959616a4392d2ad24b5b36cebfb471a31c4f571b2b5d6e996beadd4e707", "unit_id": "tag:077J:proof"}
